    "title": "High school roundup: Volleyballers start hot - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Joey Barrett ,\n1 days ago Audrey Manning (16 kills, 11 assists, 5 digs) compiled her 500th career kill as Lynnfield’s volleyball squad cruised by Hamilton-Wenham, 3-0, in straight sets of 25-14, 25-12, and 25-20. Elliana Moretti added 18 digs and seven aces, while Carina DeLeo dished out 15 assists alongside eight digs. Lynnfield 3. Read full article",
